ntry/2012/09/29/2578718/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツを着てくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の感想だったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスしてくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のレーンから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ってくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もパワーをありがとう^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2578718/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京で男子が服を買うとしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2578718/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"系統にもよるかな。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私そんなメンズまで詳しくないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2578718/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷原宿はいろんなのがあるよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/2578718/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングだった髪をバッサリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切っちゃったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら私服があまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合わなくなっちゃったの;("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんだったらどうする??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/29/257871